{"unit_id":"mitao-su__dsh-playwright-cli#card-zh","repo":"mitao-su/dsh-playwright-cli","commit":"a4e1933a55b332c036c40382c342719b7658dabc","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-playwright-cli 是面向 DSH 命令行工作区的 Playwright 测试插件。它通过 DSH shell 执行器注册四个工具，先检查本地 CLI，再按需安装浏览器、运行测试并定位 HTML 报告。测试工具支持选择文件、项目、匹配表达式、worker 数量、报告器、trace 和重试等参数；报告可通过已挂载的 Web 服务打开，也可返回本地文件路径。适合希望让 agent 在项目工作区执行浏览器端到端测试并查看结果的开发者。目标项目需具备 Node.js/npm 环境和本地 Playwright CLI；不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:461-482","src/index.ts:484-555","src/index.ts:558-641","src/index.ts:643-723"]}
{"unit_id":"mitao-su__dsh-playwright-cli#card-en","repo":"mitao-su/dsh-playwright-cli","commit":"a4e1933a55b332c036c40382c342719b7658dabc","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-playwright-cli lets DSH agents check Playwright, install browsers, run tests, and open HTML reports. Tests accept file, project, filter, reporter, trace, and retry options. Reports open via a mounted server or local file. The project needs Node.js/npm and Playwright; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:461-482","src/index.ts:484-555","src/index.ts:558-641","src/index.ts:643-723"]}
