{"unit_id":"mitao-su__dsh-playwright-cli#feature-1","repo":"mitao-su/dsh-playwright-cli","commit":"a4e1933a55b332c036c40382c342719b7658dabc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-playwright-cli 的功能「检查 Playwright CLI」：在目标工作目录检查本地 Playwright CLI 并输出版本。通过 playwright_version 工具触发，返回命令输出和退出状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:461-482"]}
{"unit_id":"mitao-su__dsh-playwright-cli#feature-2","repo":"mitao-su/dsh-playwright-cli","commit":"a4e1933a55b332c036c40382c342719b7658dabc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-playwright-cli 的功能「安装浏览器」：安装 Chromium、Firefox 或 WebKit；CLI 缺失时可先补装 @playwright/test。使用 playwright_install 工具并返回执行状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:484-555"]}
{"unit_id":"mitao-su__dsh-playwright-cli#feature-3","repo":"mitao-su/dsh-playwright-cli","commit":"a4e1933a55b332c036c40382c342719b7658dabc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-playwright-cli 的功能「运行测试」：在目标工作目录执行 Playwright 测试，可传入文件、项目、筛选条件、报告器、trace、重试等选项。通过 playwright_test 工具触发，返回执行结果和报告目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:558-641"]}
